Error [E0124]: This `if`'s branches produce different types: String (text) and Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/if_expr_branch_result_type_mismatch.jet:4:14
    |
  4 |     value :: if true -> {
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An `if` used as a value must give the same type on every path (S68)
 Fix: Make both branches produce String (text) (or the same type)
